# Host Discovery Workflow

```text
Define Authorized Targets
        ↓
Choose Target List / Range / Subnet
        ↓
Select Discovery Probe
        ↓
ARP for Local Subnet
        ↓
ICMP / TCP / UDP for Other Cases
        ↓
Review Responses and DNS Names
        ↓
Record Live Hosts
        ↓
Run Port Scanning Only If Required
```

